ght: 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;\">业务应用效果不佳</div><div style=\"width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;\">部分应用子系统操作复杂，流程数据不直观，统计分析功能陈旧，应用推进力度不够，导致应用系统业务效果不佳。</div></div><div style=\"width: 296px; height: 264px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F7FF 0%, #FEFEFF 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px rgba(86, 118, 162, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; padding-top: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; flex-shrink: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/imgs/icons/40.png?imageView2/0/format/webp/q/74\" style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;\">数据处理不够先进</div><div style=\"width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;\">现有系统缺乏不同层级的数据细分。基层助推和减负不足，管理层分析、预警、决策等不强，无法满足应用需求。</div></div><div style=\"width: 296px; height: 264px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F7FF 0%, #FEFEFF 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px rgba(86, 118, 162, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; padding-top: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; flex-shrink: 0; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/imgs/icons/39.png?imageView2/0/format/webp/q/74\" style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;\">管理分散无法统一</div><div style=\"width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;\">场馆负责能耗、停车和人员等管理。由于管理系统分散，无法进行跨专业管理，无法统一视角进行运营规划。</div></div></div></div>"
